WEBVTT

02:06.000 --> 02:07.000
It's done?

02:16.880 --> 02:19.240
Then I'll head back now.

02:22.800 --> 02:25.280
Be careful on the way. Stay safe.

02:30.880 --> 02:32.040
OK.

02:44.360 --> 02:45.440
Gu Yu.

02:56.760 --> 02:57.680
What's wrong?

03:02.320 --> 03:04.840
I bought a bottle of wine.

03:05.520 --> 03:06.880
Do you want to have some?

03:07.960 --> 03:09.000
Sure.

03:40.840 --> 03:42.600
Welcome home.

04:02.360 --> 04:04.720
He finally got a girlfriend.

04:14.800 --> 04:17.839
- Alright. Get up, get up.
- I can't. I'm sleepy.

04:17.920 --> 04:19.320
If you don't get up…

04:19.959 --> 04:20.800
I…

04:22.320 --> 04:23.520
How can you do this?

04:24.320 --> 04:25.520
Ouch, ouch, ouch.

04:37.480 --> 04:38.320
Mom.

04:39.000 --> 04:40.320
Why are you here?

04:41.800 --> 04:43.280
Did I come at the wrong time?

04:43.880 --> 04:48.200
Don't worry. I won't be a third wheel.
I'll leave as soon as I'm done.

04:50.680 --> 04:51.600
Mom,

04:52.720 --> 04:55.080
I have a girlfriend now.
Her name is Su Chengcheng.

04:55.160 --> 04:58.400
Last night, I got drunk,
and she took me home.

04:58.920 --> 05:01.840
- I'll introduce you to her later.
- Great.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.520
Time to eat.

05:17.600 --> 05:21.000
Mom, this is my girlfriend, Su…
Chengcheng.

05:27.160 --> 05:28.440
Mrs. Tang.

05:32.080 --> 05:34.120
Chengcheng and I raised this alpaca.

05:43.560 --> 05:45.840
I've become an alpaca again?

05:46.680 --> 05:48.360
Why is the filter acting crazy again?

05:49.360 --> 05:50.200
Go ahead.

06:06.440 --> 06:11.200
3D PRINTING

06:12.040 --> 06:16.680
ALPACA

06:21.600 --> 06:24.160
This alpaca can speak human language?

06:26.520 --> 06:27.680
It called me Mrs. Tang.

06:31.560 --> 06:33.680
You must've heard wrong, Mom.

06:34.360 --> 06:36.280
The alpaca has a very unique voice.

06:36.360 --> 06:40.160
Sometimes it makes sounds,
like "ah-yee-tang".

06:40.240 --> 06:43.400
Just now, you mistook that for Mrs. Tang.

06:46.160 --> 06:48.960
Oh, that's fine. It scared me.

06:49.960 --> 06:51.360
Get ready to eat.

06:53.160 --> 06:55.320
Did Chengcheng accidentally
hit the filter?

07:32.120 --> 07:33.360
He…

07:34.280 --> 07:36.800
He can't be Su Chengcheng, right?

07:37.600 --> 07:38.840
Of course not.

07:39.960 --> 07:41.080
He's Quan Shengtang.

07:41.160 --> 07:43.840
He's our friend, Quan Shengtang.

08:10.000 --> 08:11.560
He can't talk?

08:12.640 --> 08:13.640
He…

08:14.360 --> 08:16.000
His tonsils are inflamed.

08:16.920 --> 08:17.840
His throat is damaged.

08:19.000 --> 08:20.360
He can't speak now.

08:26.880 --> 08:28.000
Your girlfriend…

08:30.240 --> 08:32.120
and your friend

08:32.200 --> 08:33.760
are in your bedroom?

08:38.720 --> 08:41.280
Mom, I'll explain it later.

08:41.360 --> 08:43.320
- You go home first.
- No.

08:43.840 --> 08:45.560
I need to figure this out today.

08:46.160 --> 08:48.000
- Mom, please go home.
- Don't stop me.

08:48.080 --> 08:49.560
Mom, don't disturb them.

08:59.720 --> 09:03.120
This must be Su Chengcheng, right?

09:04.600 --> 09:05.720
No.

09:11.160 --> 09:14.280
She's Su Chengcheng's friend, Fang Jin.

09:17.800 --> 09:18.800
Hello.

09:20.400 --> 09:21.960
So, where's your girlfriend?

09:25.200 --> 09:27.960
And the other guy? Where's the alpaca?

09:35.560 --> 09:37.040
Are they inside?

09:38.880 --> 09:40.280
Mom, Mom…

09:40.360 --> 09:42.000
Could they be in there?

09:42.600 --> 09:44.400
Chengcheng can't see you right now.

09:44.480 --> 09:46.040
I'll introduce you next time.

09:48.240 --> 09:49.440
Mrs. Tang,

09:50.160 --> 09:53.680
we are studying the faux fur of alpacas.

09:54.600 --> 09:56.840
Right. Right.

09:59.200 --> 10:02.480
When Chengcheng
was taking care of the alpaca,

10:03.000 --> 10:04.120
she was accidentally kicked in the face.

10:05.760 --> 10:06.640
She's too embarrassed to meet you.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.640
- Is the injury serious?
- No.

10:09.560 --> 10:11.480
Her left cheek is swollen,

10:12.560 --> 10:14.080
but it's not a big deal.

10:14.160 --> 10:17.680
It just looks bad right now,
so she can't see you.

10:19.960 --> 10:21.920
Girls care about their image.

10:22.560 --> 10:23.680
I understand.

10:23.760 --> 10:27.120
Well, I won't see her this time.

10:28.160 --> 10:29.240
Chengcheng,

10:29.760 --> 10:32.120
I'm leaving now.

10:32.200 --> 10:35.080
Take care of your injury.
We'll talk next time.

10:36.200 --> 10:38.640
- Yeah, next time.
- Goodbye, Mrs. Tang.

10:39.680 --> 10:41.280
Goodbye. I…

10:41.360 --> 10:42.920
Mom, I'll walk you out.

10:44.880 --> 10:46.960
- Well…
- You can meet her next time.

10:58.520 --> 11:00.960
Why do you always mess up
at crucial moments?

11:03.600 --> 11:04.440
Mom.

11:06.800 --> 11:08.480
Dating isn't like doing an experiment.

11:08.560 --> 11:11.080
Don't be so rigid about everything.

11:11.160 --> 11:12.840
You need to say some sweet things.

11:13.360 --> 11:15.200
You need to pamper your girlfriend.

11:15.280 --> 11:16.480
Got it, Mom.

11:17.400 --> 11:19.240
Here, I'll book you a ride.

11:30.440 --> 11:32.200
I'm your emergency contact now.

11:32.280 --> 11:34.440
Once you're home,
I'll get a notification right away.

11:35.040 --> 11:36.040
OK.

11:36.640 --> 11:38.240
- Alright.
- I'll see you off.

11:42.120 --> 11:44.080
‪DIDI RIDE-HAILING

11:44.160 --> 11:45.920
When Chengcheng's recovered,

11:46.000 --> 11:47.560
and it's convenient for you,

11:48.080 --> 11:51.120
we should set a time for a proper meeting.

11:51.200 --> 11:53.640
Got it, Mom.
It's all you talked about on the way.

11:54.440 --> 11:56.640
- Hurry up and go back.
- Remember this.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.200
You're rushing me again.

12:01.360 --> 12:03.440
- Slow down.
- Go home.

12:18.880 --> 12:21.080
VOICE CHANGE, BEAUTY FILTER
OUTFIT, EFFECT, AUTO

12:21.160 --> 12:25.360
3D CREATION, FULL SCREEN
HIDE, 3D PRINTING

12:25.440 --> 12:27.680
The filter hasn't been updated.

12:32.800 --> 12:34.200
The weather's fine too.

12:34.280 --> 12:36.440
No thunder, no rain.

13:20.440 --> 13:22.080
Nothing's wrong.

13:29.160 --> 13:30.000
Chengcheng.

13:36.880 --> 13:38.200
It's so weird.

13:39.440 --> 13:40.880
I keep changing,

13:40.960 --> 13:44.200
but it's normal without any problems.

13:46.480 --> 13:48.800
Has the filter changed like this before?

13:53.400 --> 13:57.440
Except for system updates, it only
becomes unstable during thunderstorms.

13:57.520 --> 13:58.960
Usually, it works fine.

14:02.040 --> 14:04.680
You really like me, don't you?
You've become me.

14:08.280 --> 14:09.840
- Isn't it cute?
- It's cute.

14:11.280 --> 14:13.360
How shameless. You're flattering yourself.

14:15.080 --> 14:15.920
You're not cute then.

14:17.680 --> 14:19.400
How can you say I'm not cute?

14:20.560 --> 14:22.840
No matter what Su Chengcheng looks like,

14:22.920 --> 14:24.200
she's always the cutest.

14:33.280 --> 14:34.920
There's nothing wrong.

14:35.920 --> 14:39.040
Why did it go wrong
when I needed to meet your mom?

14:41.680 --> 14:42.800
Let's have breakfast first.

14:43.600 --> 14:46.680
We can figure out how to take it off later
and try to use it less.

14:50.920 --> 14:51.800
OK.

14:57.400 --> 14:58.400
Thanks.

15:12.920 --> 15:13.760
Is it good?

15:22.840 --> 15:25.560
My mom used to dislike cooking
and wasn't good at it either.

15:25.640 --> 15:29.200
Now that she's retired,
she actually enjoys cooking.

15:30.200 --> 15:32.760
So, remember.
When she invites you for a meal,

15:32.840 --> 15:35.200
make sure to suggest
going to a restaurant.

15:36.640 --> 15:37.760
Got it.

15:39.440 --> 15:41.200
Did I scare your mom today?

15:42.640 --> 15:44.080
She was a bit startled,

15:44.880 --> 15:49.520
but with the huge surprise,
she was too happy to notice.

15:50.360 --> 15:51.920
A huge surprise?

15:53.840 --> 15:55.360
Her son finally has a girlfriend.

16:03.680 --> 16:06.720
ANGRY SISTER

16:07.320 --> 16:08.240
It's my sister.

16:11.440 --> 16:12.280
Hello, sis.

16:12.360 --> 16:15.840
You didn't come home last night again?
Did you sleep at Tang Qi's place?

16:18.400 --> 16:20.320
Tang Qi got drunk yesterday,

16:20.400 --> 16:22.400
so I came to take care of him.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.280
Did Mom and Dad ask you to ask me?

16:24.360 --> 16:26.600
Anyway,

16:31.960 --> 16:35.000
they already know everything,
whether you want or not.

16:35.840 --> 16:40.760
Dad said he's making a big dinner,
so bring Tang Qi along after work.

16:40.840 --> 16:41.960
Tonight?

16:42.040 --> 16:42.920
Then…

16:43.440 --> 16:46.440
I'll check with Tang Qi
and discuss it with him.

16:46.520 --> 16:47.520
Su Chengcheng.

16:47.600 --> 16:49.880
I'm not asking you.

16:49.960 --> 16:51.280
I'm telling you.

16:55.240 --> 16:58.480
Done. I've called them back.

16:59.000 --> 17:00.880
Can I have breakfast now?

17:02.520 --> 17:03.360
- Sure.
- Eat.

17:03.440 --> 17:06.000
- Come on, eat. Here.
- Hurry up.

17:06.520 --> 17:09.160
I made the xiaolongbao
for you this morning.

17:09.240 --> 17:12.119
- Yes. The soy milk is still hot.
- There's also corn, good for dieting.

17:12.200 --> 17:13.040
Have some.

17:17.920 --> 17:20.160
Chengcheng is trying to trick us.

17:20.680 --> 17:22.760
I called Yuan this morning.

17:22.839 --> 17:24.960
She's also in a relationship.

17:25.040 --> 17:27.640
But she's dating seriously at home.

17:29.000 --> 17:32.960
So, Yuan makes us less worried.

17:35.960 --> 17:37.040
Right.

17:44.400 --> 17:45.440
- Good morning, Mr. Gu.
- Good morning.

17:45.520 --> 17:46.800
- Morning, Mr. Gu.
- Good morning.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.040
- Morning, Mr. Gu.
- Good morning.

17:58.040 --> 18:00.080
This is my office, right?

18:01.320 --> 18:02.760
Are you learning how to cook?

18:03.680 --> 18:06.280
May I ask what brings you here?

18:09.760 --> 18:10.960
I have a question.

18:14.560 --> 18:15.400
Go ahead.

18:18.200 --> 18:20.240
I'm going to Chengcheng's house
for dinner tonight.

18:20.760 --> 18:21.880
I'm a bit nervous.

18:22.400 --> 18:23.920
What if her parents don't like me?

18:25.560 --> 18:28.960
You're dating Su Chengcheng,
not her parents.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.520
Su Chengcheng likes you,
and that's all that matters.

18:31.360 --> 18:33.280
That's true,

18:34.440 --> 18:37.280
but Chengcheng
is very close to her parents.

18:37.360 --> 18:39.200
She really values family.

18:39.280 --> 18:42.080
I don't want her to feel torn between us.

18:42.960 --> 18:45.080
It's best to win over her parents' favor.

18:46.520 --> 18:48.680
As expected. It can only be like this.

18:49.760 --> 18:50.600
What does that mean?

18:54.920 --> 18:57.520
I've read these two books.
You can read them now.

18:58.120 --> 18:59.560
Recipes from the Garden of Contentment.

19:00.240 --> 19:01.480
My Sichuan Cuisine.

19:02.080 --> 19:05.400
Su Chengcheng's parents are skilled
in cooking, especially her dad.

19:05.480 --> 19:07.640
He loves food and is good at it.

19:07.720 --> 19:10.640
The places he loves to visit
are either the gym or the market.

19:10.720 --> 19:13.040
He values seasonal ingredients
and enjoys fresh produce.

19:16.280 --> 19:17.560
Good for you.

19:22.440 --> 19:23.920
I'll borrow all these.

19:24.840 --> 19:26.880
- These two…
- I'll be tested tonight,

19:26.960 --> 19:29.200
and I'll share the tips with you tomorrow.

19:35.480 --> 19:38.720
THE GOURMAND'S NOTES

19:50.400 --> 19:51.520
Are you nervous?

19:52.040 --> 19:54.120
- Not really.
- Just sit back and relax.

19:54.640 --> 19:55.600
Let me see.

19:56.720 --> 19:57.560
Tang.

19:57.640 --> 19:59.640
- Uncle.
- Have some fruit.

19:59.720 --> 20:00.800
- Thank you, Uncle.
- Come on.

20:01.840 --> 20:03.960
Even if it looks a bit rough…

20:04.040 --> 20:06.240
I love the domestic Huaniu apples.

20:06.320 --> 20:09.760
The imported Red Delicious
at the supermarket looks shiny and pretty,

20:09.840 --> 20:12.400
but they don't taste as fruity
as Huaniu apples.

20:13.520 --> 20:14.440
An expert.

20:15.480 --> 20:18.120
The supermarket only has Red Delicious.

20:18.200 --> 20:21.560
The Huaniu apples are rare.
You can hardly find them.

20:22.120 --> 20:23.520
- Chengcheng, try some too.
- Aunt.

20:23.600 --> 20:24.560
Don't stand on ceremony. Sit down.

20:25.160 --> 20:27.480
Try some freshly brewed tea.

20:27.560 --> 20:28.640
Thank you, Aunt.

20:29.160 --> 20:30.560
It's hot. Be careful.

20:36.720 --> 20:38.120
This is white tea, right?

20:40.560 --> 20:42.080
My mom loves white tea too.

20:42.160 --> 20:45.760
But this tastes a little different
from my mom's tea.

20:45.840 --> 20:47.920
This tea is grown by Chengcheng's uncle.

20:48.000 --> 20:50.960
If you like it,
you can take two bags when you leave,

20:51.040 --> 20:52.320
so your mom can try it too.

20:52.400 --> 20:54.360
Then I'll take some. Thank you, Aunt.

20:59.280 --> 21:00.960
Have some fruit. You chat.

21:01.040 --> 21:03.880
There are two more dishes in the kitchen.
We'll have dinner once they're ready.

21:03.960 --> 21:05.040
- OK.
- OK.

21:05.120 --> 21:06.440
Chengcheng, come and help.

21:07.400 --> 21:08.600
Bye.

21:14.840 --> 21:16.040
Chengcheng,

21:16.760 --> 21:20.040
go to the supermarket in the neighborhood
and buy vinegar for me.

21:22.680 --> 21:23.920
Isn't there vinegar here?

21:25.280 --> 21:28.600
I want white vinegar,
the kind used for cold dishes.

21:28.680 --> 21:31.040
It's all vinegar. The taste is similar.

21:31.120 --> 21:32.560
Of course, they're not the same.

21:32.640 --> 21:36.400
You've taken everything after your dad,
but not his tongue.

21:36.480 --> 21:38.240
Go on. Go.

21:39.200 --> 21:41.760
- Make sure to buy Baoning Vinegar.
- Got it.

21:52.320 --> 21:54.560
This was taken when Chengcheng was six.

21:59.720 --> 22:05.120
This was taken when she was ten.
I got a silver medal back then.

22:06.120 --> 22:08.520
This was taken when she was 15.

22:09.200 --> 22:10.360
How's this pose?

22:14.800 --> 22:15.800
Not bad, right?

22:17.560 --> 22:20.480
You look so strong and powerful.

22:23.640 --> 22:25.160
Well said.

22:25.920 --> 22:29.640
Enough about photos. Eat something.

22:30.840 --> 22:32.320
Let me crack some walnuts for you.

22:45.480 --> 22:47.440
A bit too hard.

22:52.320 --> 22:53.360
I brought them especially for you.

22:53.880 --> 22:55.600
You must be tired.
Have some to nourish your brain.

22:58.120 --> 22:59.040
Tang,

23:03.080 --> 23:05.240
this is Chengcheng's first relationship.

23:06.000 --> 23:08.160
She's a straightforward girl.

23:08.760 --> 23:12.480
If you're dating, date seriously.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.080
Even if

23:15.880 --> 23:17.720
things don't work out one day,

23:17.800 --> 23:20.080
just be honest about it.

23:21.480 --> 23:23.160
If there's anything sneaky,

23:23.960 --> 23:25.720
making things complicated,

23:26.960 --> 23:28.280
I'll be angry.

23:31.400 --> 23:33.680
Uncle, I'll remember your words.

23:35.680 --> 23:37.520
This is also my first relationship.

23:38.520 --> 23:39.840
If I do anything wrong,

23:39.920 --> 23:41.760
please feel free to criticize me,

23:42.280 --> 23:43.120
and I'll change.

23:44.840 --> 23:46.520
It's your first time too?

23:52.720 --> 23:54.400
I'll crack two more walnuts for you.

23:56.920 --> 23:57.800
Here you go.

23:58.440 --> 23:59.800
This is much better.

24:00.440 --> 24:02.160
- Eat.
- Thank you, Uncle.

24:04.480 --> 24:08.000
Don't tell Chengcheng
what happened just now.

24:08.960 --> 24:09.800
OK.

24:16.000 --> 24:16.960
Tastes good.

25:25.440 --> 25:26.560
You're back?

25:27.680 --> 25:31.440
The dishes are almost ready.
Your vinegar is the last ingredient.

25:31.520 --> 25:33.760
The shop assistant said
the vinegar was sold out.

25:33.840 --> 25:34.800
Where is she?

25:35.400 --> 25:36.720
- I'm here.
- Her shoes…

25:37.240 --> 25:39.680
Chengcheng,

25:39.760 --> 25:42.280
I'm waiting for your vinegar. Look at you…

25:42.880 --> 25:43.840
Su,

25:44.520 --> 25:47.000
- has Chengcheng come back?
- I haven't seen her.

25:47.520 --> 25:48.760
That's impossible.

25:49.280 --> 25:52.000
I heard the door.
Her shoes are at the door.

25:52.520 --> 25:55.960
You must've heard wrong.
She probably went out in other shoes.

25:56.480 --> 25:59.520
How could I have heard wrong?
How could I mistake the sound of a door?

25:59.600 --> 26:01.600
Mom. Mom.

26:02.200 --> 26:04.520
Mom, can't you see me? Mom.

26:04.600 --> 26:07.560
This was probably
when she was six or seven.

26:07.640 --> 26:09.520
Dad, can you hear me?

26:09.600 --> 26:10.440
Dad.

26:10.520 --> 26:12.080
- She's been practicing Yongchun.
- Tang Qi.

26:12.600 --> 26:13.600
Tang Qi.

26:13.680 --> 26:15.600
- Come on.
- This is when she was eight.

26:15.680 --> 26:17.320
Can't you see me or hear me?

26:17.400 --> 26:18.920
She started to care about her appearance.

26:21.080 --> 26:22.200
The filter…

26:27.600 --> 26:30.480
Oh, no.
The control panel isn't responding.

27:12.040 --> 27:13.840
She still had baby fat at that time.

27:13.920 --> 27:15.720
She was quite chubby as a kid.

27:22.040 --> 27:24.040
- Hello, Chengcheng.
- Hello, Tang Qi.

27:24.120 --> 27:26.080
This filter is going crazy.
I'm invisible now.

27:26.160 --> 27:27.200
Hello?

27:28.040 --> 27:29.960
Hello? Can't you hear me?

27:31.200 --> 27:32.280
Hello?

27:32.360 --> 27:33.840
Can you hear me, Chengcheng?

27:34.360 --> 27:36.360
- Hello?
- The signal is bad?

27:37.240 --> 27:38.360
Hello?

27:41.480 --> 27:43.480
My voice is blocked by the filter.

27:44.040 --> 27:45.240
They can't hear me.

27:46.440 --> 27:47.560
What happened to Chengcheng?

27:48.080 --> 27:49.160
Chengcheng.

27:50.040 --> 27:51.760
Tang, what's going on?

27:53.000 --> 27:54.080
I'll call her.

27:57.040 --> 27:58.000
Is something wrong?

27:59.440 --> 28:02.120
Chengcheng is strong,
and the supermarket is just downstairs.

28:02.200 --> 28:03.160
What could have happened?

28:08.520 --> 28:09.920
Chengcheng messaged me on WeChat.

28:10.440 --> 28:12.920
Come out. Don't make my parents worry.

28:13.440 --> 28:15.320
She asked me to pick her up.

28:16.320 --> 28:18.480
- Go then. Go, go.
- OK.

28:30.280 --> 28:32.880
Tang, the vinegar doesn't matter.

28:32.960 --> 28:35.560
Dinner's about to start.
Just pick her up and come back.

28:35.640 --> 28:36.720
OK.

28:48.880 --> 28:49.800
Chengcheng?

28:52.240 --> 28:53.120
Chengcheng?

28:56.640 --> 28:57.640
Chengcheng?

28:59.080 --> 29:00.160
Where are you?

29:00.800 --> 29:01.640
Cheng…

29:18.680 --> 29:19.640
Chengcheng?

29:24.240 --> 29:25.080
Chengcheng?

29:31.120 --> 29:31.960
Chengcheng?

29:38.600 --> 29:39.600
Chengcheng?

29:45.840 --> 29:46.800
Chengcheng.

30:03.840 --> 30:04.680
Chengcheng.

30:05.200 --> 30:06.320
Don't be scared.

30:09.280 --> 30:11.280
Whatever is wrong with the filter,

30:12.000 --> 30:13.440
we'll fix it.

30:17.320 --> 30:20.120
It's not the first time
the filter malfunctioned.

30:20.640 --> 30:21.600
I'm not scared.

30:21.680 --> 30:24.720
The filter's hidden your body visually,

30:24.800 --> 30:29.320
and it's blocked all the sounds
coming from you audibly.

30:30.520 --> 30:32.360
Others can't see you or hear you,

30:35.560 --> 30:36.840
but actually, I can touch you.

30:38.360 --> 30:40.000
If the phone isn't near your body,

30:40.800 --> 30:42.000
it still makes sounds.

30:43.560 --> 30:46.400
So, it's all just an illusion.
It'll be fine.

30:46.480 --> 30:48.160
Everything will return to normal.

30:51.840 --> 30:53.160
- I can use the phone.
- You can use the phone.

30:54.640 --> 30:57.120
If you have something to say,
just send me a message.

31:05.080 --> 31:07.360
I was wondering how to explain it to you,

31:07.880 --> 31:10.800
but you're so smart
and guessed everything right.

31:18.200 --> 31:20.440
The filter has been abnormal
since this morning.

31:31.720 --> 31:33.160
Is your body feeling okay?

31:35.840 --> 31:38.200
No, everything's fine.

31:38.880 --> 31:42.280
I've just become invisible,
like the demons in TV shows.

31:54.880 --> 31:58.280
Being invisible
means the body objectively disappears,

31:58.800 --> 32:00.280
and you can't see it or touch it.

32:01.480 --> 32:05.000
This is more like a visual block.

32:05.840 --> 32:07.280
It's still within the realm of technology.

32:27.120 --> 32:27.960
Tang,

32:40.560 --> 32:41.440
are you okay?

32:43.720 --> 32:44.720
Don't make my dad worry.

32:44.800 --> 32:47.400
Uncle, why did you come downstairs?

32:48.120 --> 32:50.520
I wasn't worried, so I came down to check.

32:51.800 --> 32:55.160
Who were you talking to just now?

32:55.720 --> 32:57.800
I was talking to Chengcheng on the phone.

32:57.880 --> 33:00.240
That naughty girl.
She went to buy some vinegar,

33:00.320 --> 33:02.080
but she hasn't come back yet.

33:03.760 --> 33:05.960
Uncle, don't worry.

33:06.040 --> 33:08.480
Chengcheng
got an urgent call from the company

33:08.560 --> 33:10.120
and had to rush

33:10.800 --> 33:12.280
to meet a client.

33:13.200 --> 33:14.360
So urgent?

33:23.200 --> 33:24.040
FAMILY GROUP CHAT

33:24.120 --> 33:25.720
Dad, Mom,

33:25.800 --> 33:28.480
there's an emergency at work.
I need to go back to handle it.

33:28.560 --> 33:30.680
I didn't have time to tell you. Sorry.

33:31.640 --> 33:33.240
I might be away for a few days.

33:33.320 --> 33:36.200
Mom, can you pack some clothes for me
and give them to Tang Qi?

33:36.280 --> 33:37.680
I'll come back once the work is done.

33:39.160 --> 33:40.800
She is going on a business trip.

33:42.440 --> 33:46.000
Work is important. Stay safe.

33:46.080 --> 33:47.600
DAD

33:48.120 --> 33:51.520
Remember to eat on time.
Don't ruin your stomach.

33:51.600 --> 33:52.960
MOM

33:53.040 --> 33:56.360
Don't worry. I'm going with my colleagues.

33:56.440 --> 33:57.520
They'll look after me on the way.

33:57.600 --> 34:01.000
SU CHENGCHENG

34:04.560 --> 34:07.400
Tang, you're visiting for the first time,

34:07.480 --> 34:09.800
but Chengcheng rushed to work.

34:09.880 --> 34:12.480
We didn't even get to enjoy
this nice meal.

34:12.560 --> 34:15.440
Chengcheng is serious about her work.

34:15.520 --> 34:17.280
She just has too much work.

34:19.440 --> 34:22.440
Uncle, maybe I should go home now.

34:22.520 --> 34:24.520
No, no, you can't leave like this.

34:24.600 --> 34:27.520
The food's ready.
You can't leave on an empty stomach.

34:27.600 --> 34:29.520
Besides, you need to have dinner anyway.

34:30.560 --> 34:32.199
Have it here. Come on.

34:33.719 --> 34:35.920
My dad's cooking is top-notch.
You must try it.

34:42.920 --> 34:45.520
Tang,
it's just the three of us for dinner.

34:45.600 --> 34:46.920
Make yourself at home.

34:52.480 --> 34:53.480
Sit first.

34:54.679 --> 34:56.360
OK, I'll sit. You sit too.

35:00.720 --> 35:02.960
Chengcheng isn't here anyway.

35:03.040 --> 35:05.280
Why not move this chair away?

35:09.600 --> 35:10.440
Uncle,

35:11.840 --> 35:13.000
I…

35:13.840 --> 35:15.360
I want to have a sense of ceremony

35:16.160 --> 35:20.360
and pretend that Chengcheng
is eating with me.

35:21.040 --> 35:22.280
Alright, whatever you like.

35:26.240 --> 35:28.320
- Thank you for this.
- It's okay.

35:28.920 --> 35:31.640
Tang, our cooking isn't great.

35:31.720 --> 35:33.520
Just try it out of goodwill.

35:34.080 --> 35:36.720
Here. This is blood duck,

35:36.800 --> 35:38.600
Chengcheng's favorite dish.

35:38.680 --> 35:39.560
Try it.

35:39.640 --> 35:40.840
- Thanks, Aunt.
- Eat more.

35:51.280 --> 35:53.480
- I'll have the soup first.
- OK.

35:53.560 --> 35:55.000
Alright, thanks.

35:55.640 --> 35:59.760
According to Chengcheng,
you watch this drama every night, right?

36:01.520 --> 36:02.520
It's turned on.

36:03.120 --> 36:05.720
Yes. Though we can watch it online,

36:05.800 --> 36:08.600
we still prefer
watching it on TV every night.

36:09.600 --> 36:12.040
It seems a bit less free,

36:12.120 --> 36:14.760
but as you young people would say,

36:15.440 --> 36:18.600
it's a sense of ceremony to sit

36:18.680 --> 36:21.160
in front of the TV every night.

36:23.920 --> 36:24.840
You finished it?

36:24.920 --> 36:26.760
You've got a good appetite.

36:27.280 --> 36:30.280
You and Chengcheng can eat together.

36:30.360 --> 36:31.680
Have another one.

36:32.200 --> 36:33.880
Sweet skin chicken.

36:33.960 --> 36:36.960
It's your uncle's specialty,
also Chengcheng's favorite.

36:38.000 --> 36:39.120
Thanks, Uncle.

36:41.600 --> 36:42.640
You eat too.

36:44.560 --> 36:45.680
It seems like the climax is coming.

37:11.920 --> 37:14.040
- What's this?
- Don't be scared. I'm here.

37:22.560 --> 37:24.960
- This…
- What's this?

37:27.320 --> 37:28.640
Uncle, Aunt, don't be scared.

37:34.600 --> 37:35.680
This is a magic trick.

37:36.480 --> 37:38.680
- A magic trick?
- It's a magic trick?

37:39.240 --> 37:41.680
A magic trick. Look at how scared you are.

37:41.760 --> 37:44.320
It's fine. It's magic.

37:45.880 --> 37:46.720
Yeah.

37:47.320 --> 37:50.360
This is a magic trick
I've been practicing recently.

37:52.480 --> 37:56.200
Now, I'm going to make this chicken leg
defy gravity

37:58.080 --> 37:59.400
and float in the air.

38:00.680 --> 38:01.520
Come on, come on.

38:08.600 --> 38:09.440
Up.

38:13.080 --> 38:14.080
Up.

38:15.160 --> 38:16.200
Stay.

38:23.560 --> 38:24.920
Fall.

38:27.280 --> 38:28.560
Wow, that's amazing!

38:28.640 --> 38:30.560
I didn't see that coming.

38:30.640 --> 38:32.480
- How did you do it?
- How?

38:36.920 --> 38:38.000
Thank you.

38:44.600 --> 38:46.440
Come on. Stop teasing us.

38:46.520 --> 38:47.960
Reveal the secret.

38:48.040 --> 38:49.200
Just reveal the secret.

38:52.760 --> 38:54.280
I learned it from a magician

38:56.000 --> 38:57.560
to give Chengcheng a surprise.

38:58.280 --> 39:00.680
Let's keep some mystery for now.

39:01.480 --> 39:04.960
After I show Chengcheng,
I'll explain it to you.

39:07.160 --> 39:08.200
- How thoughtful.
- OK.

39:09.160 --> 39:10.520
- Let's eat.
- Eat, eat.

39:10.600 --> 39:12.720
- Let me serve you some soup.
- Thanks, Aunt.

39:49.360 --> 39:51.800
Seems the invisibility function
has its limits.

40:12.160 --> 40:14.120
- The cup can't be invisible.
- The cup can't be invisible.

40:33.520 --> 40:34.600
Try my phone.

40:46.960 --> 40:48.800
My phone can't be invisible,

40:50.440 --> 40:52.280
but your phone can.

40:56.480 --> 40:57.920
Try it with the other hand.

41:12.240 --> 41:14.840
If it's about the size of the object…

41:15.840 --> 41:17.880
Our phones are about the same size.

41:17.960 --> 41:21.880
Why can mine go invisible but yours can't?

41:32.680 --> 41:35.520
The filter probably works
like a digital space.

41:36.720 --> 41:42.160
It turns your body, clothes, accessories,
and phone into data

41:43.640 --> 41:45.880
and turns it into a virtual mirror image

41:46.680 --> 41:48.240
to create a visual illusion

41:49.080 --> 41:50.600
that makes us think we can't see anything.

42:01.240 --> 42:02.280
I don't get it.

42:08.480 --> 42:11.640
You can think of it simply

42:12.560 --> 42:15.640
as that the filter has the initial data
of your phone,

42:15.720 --> 42:16.960
but it doesn't have mine,

42:17.040 --> 42:21.200
so the filter can use the data
to hide your phone.

42:22.040 --> 42:23.480
Got it.

42:29.080 --> 42:30.640
Chengcheng, take a look.

42:31.480 --> 42:33.640
Is the old lady who gave you
the bracelet like this?

42:41.840 --> 42:42.960
Very similar.

42:44.480 --> 42:45.880
Only the one who tied the bell
can untie it.

42:45.960 --> 42:48.320
I'll go find her at the place
where you got the filter.

43:01.120 --> 43:02.960
It's so late. You should go tomorrow.

43:17.440 --> 43:18.880
The filter has had glitches before.

43:18.960 --> 43:21.840
Maybe it's temporary like before.

43:21.920 --> 43:22.840
It may get better after one night.

43:23.880 --> 43:27.280
This is different from before.
The control panel has disappeared.

43:33.240 --> 43:36.360
It's so late now. Even if you go,

43:36.440 --> 43:38.240
the old lady might have left.

43:43.240 --> 43:44.840
It's indeed late now.

43:47.440 --> 43:48.560
Maybe

43:50.280 --> 43:52.080
she still hasn't sold everything

43:52.600 --> 43:53.640
and hasn't packed up yet.

44:03.120 --> 44:05.440
You always comfort me,
saying it'll be fine,

44:05.960 --> 44:09.480
but actually,
you're more worried than I am, right?

44:16.160 --> 44:17.480
Are you afraid of being alone at home?

44:18.280 --> 44:20.400
Is that why you don't want me to go?

44:29.040 --> 44:30.560
I promise you.

44:32.040 --> 44:34.040
I'll never use the filter again,

44:35.640 --> 44:37.000
so you don't have to worry.

44:46.280 --> 44:47.200
Alright.

44:48.360 --> 44:51.600
I'll go find the old lady
who sells flowers tomorrow morning.

45:05.240 --> 45:06.840
Luckily, you're here.

45:10.400 --> 45:11.360
Don't be afraid.

45:12.720 --> 45:14.120
No matter what happens,

45:15.760 --> 45:17.400
I'll face it with you.

45:22.960 --> 45:24.000
I love you.
